OL,4,CCity's Christmas market 'boring', say  
OL,5,Cvisitors                               
OL,6,GVisitors to Liverpool's Christmas      
OL,7,Gmarket have criticised a lack of       
OL,8,Gvariety, with some saying there are    
OL,9,Gtoo many food and drink stands and not 
OL,10,Genough opportunities to buy gifts.     
OL,12,FThe market returned to St George's     
OL,13,FPlateau this month as part of event    
OL,14,Forganiser Underbelly's new festive     
OL,15,Fattraction, Skate St George's, which   
OL,16,Falso features an ice rink, rides and   
OL,17,Flive entertainment.                    
OL,22,                                   G1/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
