OL,4,CMan who died from head injury was      
OL,5,C'bubbly dad'                           
OL,6,GA man who died from a head injury      
OL,7,Gnearly two weeks after collapsing in a 
OL,8,Gcar park was a "bubbly dad" with not   
OL,9,G"a bad bone in his body", his family   
OL,10,Ghave said.                             
OL,12,FSteve Manifold, 35, was found in a car 
OL,13,Fpark on Kent Street, Preston, on 31    
OL,14,FAugust and died in hospital on 13      
OL,15,FSeptember.                             
OL,17,FA post-mortem examination found        
OL,18,FManifold, from Preston, died from "a   
OL,19,Fsignificant" head injury. Lancashire   
OL,20,FPolice said his death was being        
OL,21,Ftreated as suspicious and the          
OL,22,Finvestigation was ongoing.        G3/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
