OL,4,CMan charged with making explosives     
OL,5,Cafter street evacuation                
OL,6,GA man has been charged with making     
OL,7,Gexplosives after dozens of residents   
OL,8,Gwere forced to leave their homes.      
OL,10,FPeople from 23 houses on Shelley Grove 
OL,11,Fin Droylsden, Manchester, were         
OL,12,Fevacuated on 18 November after police  
OL,13,Fsaid a discovery had been made during  
OL,14,Fan "unrelated investigation". They     
OL,15,Fwere only able to return six days      
OL,16,Flater.                                 
OL,18,FJames Quinn, 29, of Shelley Grove, in  
OL,19,FDroylsden, has been charged with six   
OL,20,Fcounts of making or possessing an      
OL,21,Fexplosive substance under suspicious   
OL,22,Fcircumstances.                    G4/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
